Case list for a CTS check of continuation-mode compile time (not for merging).

Build this branch with the Vulkan asahi driver and run every case in lss.txt
(dEQP-VK.ray_tracing_pipeline.large_shader_set.*) with
ASAHI_G17P_RT_CONTINUATION=1 in the environment, which forces continuation
mode at every recursion depth. Cap each case at 90 s.
Pass bar: every case passes, and each *.4096 case takes well under 90 s
(before this fix they took 86-307 s in continuation mode).
